• The key features of Fundamental Duties are: 


• Fundamental Duties are not legally enforceable by the courts.

• These duties serve as a moral compass to guide the behavior and actions of citizens.

• The duties encompass values, patriotism, environmental consciousness, the promotion of harmony and scientific temper.
